chor":null},"note_id":null,"start":16,"end":41},{"id":"lvzang-q-9bc5fca55b7296b8bed9","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-e2f3b3d6a80ec490e88c","layer":"pei","quote":"是时，边方有警，羌胡出寇；三府举能，迁旻匈奴中郎将。讨贼有功，征拜议郎","attribution":"裴注·后汉书（谢承）","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-3473eb9b61408b668d54","start":63,"end":98},{"id":"lvzang-q-afd96e6bd01355cd5ce4","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-e2f3b3d6a80ec490e88c","layer":"pei","quote":"初从徐州从事辟司徒府，除卢奴令；冀州举尤异，迁扬州刺史、丹杨太守","attribution":"谢承《后汉书》","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-3473eb9b61408b668d54","start":30,"end":62},{"id":"sunshi-e-o003a-q","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-814b1759af34c636983c","layer":"original","quote":"刺史臧旻列上功状〖13〗；诏书除坚盐渎丞〖14〗。数岁，徙盱眙丞〖15〗。又徙下邳丞〖16〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":50},{"id":"sunshi-q-o003","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-814b1759af34c636983c","layer":"original","quote":"刺史臧旻列上功状〖13〗；诏书除坚盐渎丞〖14〗。数岁，徙盱眙丞〖15〗。又徙下邳丞〖16〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":50},{"id":"wuhuan-q-a7b923dd64f6224fbc6a","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-e9a454234ba7f931bce2","layer":"pei","quote":"檀石槐帅部众逆击，旻等败走，兵马还者，什一而已","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c75611b8bc4bb2c4f479","start":563,"end":586},{"id":"wuhuan-q-c87688a1b2d784969ebb","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-e9a454234ba7f931bce2","layer":"pei","quote":"（嘉）〔熹〕平六年，遣护乌丸校尉夏育、破鲜卑中郎将田晏、匈奴中郎将臧旻与南单于，出雁门塞，三道并进，径二千余里，征之","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c75611b8bc4bb2c4f47